    reg {
        name = "GMACN_ADDRX_LOW";
        desc = "GMACN_ADDRX_LOW is the register for the lower 32 bits [31:0] of the X-th (1 to 15) MAC address of GMACn (0 to 1). GMACN_ADDRX_LOW (offset 0x004C+Xx0x8 (X = 0~14), total reset 0xFFFF_FFFF; PROVEN: Hi3535 data sheet, PDF page 817, section 5.6). Registers for X = 1..15 (offset 0x44 + n x 0x4000 + X x 0x8; instances 0..14 below are X = 1..15). Address registers 1-15 (X) and 16-31 (Y) of GMAC n sit at the formula offsets of the data sheet (0x40 + n x 0x4000 + X x 0x8 / 0x780 + n x 0x4000 + Y x 0x8); modelled for GMAC 0 as 15 resp. 16 instances, GMAC 1 is the same layout 0x4000 higher.";
