- 0: Do not freeze the MMC counters.
- 1: Freeze the MMC counters. All MMC counters are then not updated until this bit is set to 0 again. While this bit is 1, all MMC counters can be cleared on read.";
            sw = rw; hw = r;
            reset = 0x0;
        } mmc_cf[3:3];
        field {
